n\n* Built in database includes 20,000+ cities\n* Information page for city includes the date and time of next daylight savings change as well as sunrise and sunset times", "bundleId": "com.timescroller.TimeScroller", "trackCensoredName": "TimeScroller - timezone helper", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/timescroller-timezone-helper/id288013812?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "sellerName": "TimeScroller Pty Limited", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "primaryGenreName": "Business", "primaryGenreId": 6000, "genres": ["비즈니스", "유틸리티"], "artistId": 288013815, "artistName": "Terry Brett", "userRatingCount": 0}]}